":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII(writer, str) "
"<PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII>`."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCIIString`: عبارت "
"``_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCIIString(&writer, str)`` را با "
":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII(writer, str) "
"<PyUnicodeWriter_WriteASCII>` جایگزین کنید."

msgid ""
":c:func:`!_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteLatin1String`: replace "
"``_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteLatin1String(&writer, str)`` with "
":c:func:`PyUnicodeWriter_WriteUTF8(writer, str) "
"<PyUnicodeWriter_WriteUTF8>`."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!_PyUnicodeWriter_WriteLatin1String`: عبارت "
